scriptome atlas of the mouse brain at cellular resolution</article-title><source>Current Opinion in Neurobiology</source><volume>12</volume><fpage>562</fpage><lpage>5</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12367636</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b13-cin-6-0047"><label>13</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Strausberg</surname><given-names>RL</given-names></name><name><surname>Buetow</surname><given-names>KH</given-names></name><name><surname>Emmert-Buck</surname><given-names>MR</given-names></name><name><surname>Klausner</surname><given-names>RD</given-names></name></person-group><year>2000</year><article-title>The Cancer Genome Anatomy Project: building an annotated gene index</article-title><source>Trends in Genetics</source><volume>16</volume><fpage>103</fpage><lpage>6</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10689348</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b14-cin-6-0047"><label>14</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wheeler</surname><given-names>DL</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2003</year><article-title>Database resources of the National Center for Biotechnology</article-title><source>Nucl. Acids Res</source><volume>31</volume><fpage>28</fpage><lpage>33</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12519941</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b15-cin-6-0047"><label>15</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Zhou</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Cui</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name></person-group><year>2004</year><article-title>GeneInfoViz: Constructing and visualizing gene relation networks In Silico Biology 4[0026]</article-title><source>Ref Type: Journal (Full)</source><fpage>323</fpage><lpage>33</lpage></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b16-cin-6-0047"><label>16</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><per